    "notes": "Schedule 1 explicitly lists 'Theatrical Motion Pictures' as a category and applies undiscounted full rates (no 3% reduction, no lag, no sideletter terms). Schedule 9 (Distant Location Minimum Wage Schedule) likewise lists 'Theatrical Motion Pictures' and applies undiscounted full rates. Schedules 2 and 10 are the 3%-reduced versions, Schedules 3, 4, 5, 8, and 11 are one-year/two-year lag or long-form sideletter versions, and Schedules 6 and 7 apply only to one-half hour prime time dramatic television (not theatrical), so all were excluded. Note that Schedule 1's category list includes theatrical pictures alongside various television categories, but the wage rates themselves are the same full-scale rates regardless of category within that schedule."
  },
